_:n426229a16cc0497a9255d954688a4228b1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        At least one rml:predicate or rml:predicateMap must be provided.\n        " .
_:n80a93eb001cf461d89138e59ec4f7616b7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n80a93eb001cf461d89138e59ec4f7616b8 .
