<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLFunctionMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n    Represents a Function Map.\n    " .
_:n5549a0c23aee408f9021f358a9a949dbb3 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        A Term Map MAY contain one or more rml:logicalTarget properties to\n        export all triples containing the generated term to different\n        targets.\n        " .
_:n426229a16cc0497a9255d954688a4228b5 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLPredicateMapShape> .
