_:N71a72cdca80e4e68803e67ee874cc56a <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:Nbfa4f5a21abd4d65ac606003252636c7 .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/LogicalViewJoinShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n    Node must have a valid rml:LogicalViewJoin description.\r\n    rml:LogicalViewJoin requires:\r\n    - exactly one rml:parentLogicalView property.\r\n    - one or more rml:joinCondition properties.\r\n    - one or more rml:field properties.\r\n    Furthermore, rml:Field requires what an rml:ExpressionMap requires.\r\n    " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/InclusionAnnotationShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/StructuralAnnotationShape> .
_:n0629f31ab7d74688ab6ff3bf859c9de9b12 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:nf78632a5910a4d68861fe0ce48f99cdeb26 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "Two distinct fields in this view's effective field set (its own fields plus any introduced by leftJoin/innerJoin) share the same rml:fieldName." .
_:n27cbab76055345c195dd863712148eb4b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        Exactly one rml:function or rml:functionMap is required.\n        " .
