_:n5f959be9d20e408493bb5221b51ef438b3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:template must be a string with well-formed brace delimiters:\n        every unescaped '{' must be closed by an unescaped '}' with no\n        unescaped braces in between, and every literal '{', '}', or '\\'\n        (both inside and outside reference expressions) must be\n        backslash-escaped.\n        " .
_:n1402647acbbf4b9ca83cf52a131006e0b1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n1402647acbbf4b9ca83cf52a131006e0b2 .
_:ne3fbda41b12649f28a5726c36450a78db1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:mode must be specified by any of the modes from rml:Mode class.\n        " .
